From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:55:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/bridge: dw-hdmi: Size output bus format array for all candidates

dw_hdmi_bridge_atomic_get_output_bus_fmts() can add four YUV 4:2:0
formats for modes which also allow other formats, followed by RGB888
and up to ten deep color and YUV 4:2:2/4:4:4 ones, so 15 in total
for a sink with 16-bit and YUV support. The array only has room for
11 of them. Size it for all candidates.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-hdmi.c | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-hdmi.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-hdmi.c
index ec346c550ac2..f15f7522fdac 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-hdmi.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-hdmi.c
@@ -2699,8 +2699,12 @@ static int dw_hdmi_connector_create(struct dw_hdmi *hdmi)
  * - MEDIA_BUS_FMT_YUV8_1X24,
  */
 
-/* Can return a maximum of 11 possible output formats for a mode/connector */
-#define MAX_OUTPUT_SEL_FORMATS	11
+/*
+ * Can return a maximum of 15 possible output formats for a mode/connector:
+ * four YUV 4:2:0 ones for modes which also allow other formats, followed
+ * by RGB888, two 16-bit, three 12-bit, three 10-bit and two 8-bit ones.
+ */
+#define MAX_OUTPUT_SEL_FORMATS	15
 
 static u32 *dw_hdmi_bridge_atomic_get_output_bus_fmts(struct drm_bridge *bridge,
 					struct drm_bridge_state *bridge_state,
-- 
2.43.0

